2.          In the second stage of ESH, the types of plans and related documents that can
be submitted via ESH cover plan submissions for the works below. Submissions for A&A
works are excluded.

      (a)   hoarding, covered walkway and gantry;

      (b)   demolition works;

      (c)   drainage works;

      (d)   excavation and lateral support works;

      (e)   ground investigation works;

       (f)   foundation works;

      (g)   site formation works; and

      (h)    all structural works.

